  - time: 11
    duration: 2.6
    english: KigaliLink is not responding.
    french: "KigaliLink ne r\xE9pond plus."
    kinyarwanda: KigaliLink ntisubiza.
  - time: 15.5
    duration: 2.8
    english: Every drone in the city just changed hands.
    french: Tous les drones de la ville viennent de changer de camp.
    kinyarwanda: Drone zose zo mu mujyi zigaruriwe n'undi.
  - time: 18.4
    duration: 2.6
    english: Relay towers are under attack.
    french: "Les tours relais sont attaqu\xE9es."
    kinyarwanda: Iminara ihuza umuyoboro iri guterwa.
  - time: 23.2
    duration: 2.9
    english: Skyguard volunteers, go up.
    french: Volontaires Skyguard, montez.
    kinyarwanda: Abakorerabushake ba Skyguard, nimuzamuke.
  - time: 29.5
    duration: 4.3
    english: Hi, I'm Ishema. I'll be with you until dawn.
    french: "Salut, je suis Ishema. Je serai avec toi jusqu'\xE0 l'aube."
    kinyarwanda: Muraho, ndi Ishema. Nzaba ndi kumwe nawe kugeza bucyeye.
  holdToSkip: 1
